fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"mpegts/gstmpegtssection.html#gst_mpegts_section_get_tsdt","fragment":"\n\tgst_mpegts_section_get_tsdt\n\n\n\tGstMpegts.Section.prototype.get_tsdt\n\n\n\tGstMpegts.Section.get_tsdt\n\nParses a Transport Stream Description Table.\nReturns the array of GstMpegtsDescriptor contained in the section\nParameters:\na GstMpegtsSection of type GST_MPEGTS_SECTION_TSDT\n(transfer container) (element-type GstMpegtsDescriptor) (nullable):\nThe array of GstMpegtsDescriptor contained in the section, or NULL if an\nerror happened. Release with g_array_unref when done.\nParses a Transport Stream Description Table.\nReturns the array of GstMpegts.Descriptor contained in the section\nParameters:\na GstMpegts.Section of type GstMpegts.SectionType.TSDT\n(transfer container) (element-type GstMpegtsDescriptor) (nullable):\nThe array of GstMpegts.Descriptor contained in the section, or null if an\nerror happened. Release with g_array_unref (not introspectable) when done.\nParses a Transport Stream Description Table.\nReturns the array of GstMpegts.Descriptor contained in the section\nParameters:\na GstMpegts.Section of type GstMpegts.SectionType.TSDT\n(transfer container) (element-type GstMpegtsDescriptor) (nullable):\nThe array of GstMpegts.Descriptor contained in the section, or None if an\nerror happened. Release with g_array_unref (not introspectable) when done.\n"});